<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Teovox — Briefing para criação do seu site</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  :root {
    --blue-900: #0B1F3A;
    --blue-800: #112D52;
    --blue-700: #174070;
    --blue-600: #1E5490;
    --blue-500: #2169B8;
    --blue-400: #3A82D0;
    --blue-300: #6AAAE4;
    --blue-200: #A3C8F0;
    --blue-100: #D6E8F9;
    --blue-50: #EEF5FD;

    --lead-900: #141414;
    --lead-800: #1E1E1E;
    --lead-700: #2A2A2A;
    --lead-600: #373737;
    --lead-500: #4A4A4A;
    --lead-400: #606060;
    --lead-300: #888888;
    --lead-200: #B0B0B0;
    --lead-100: #D8D8D8;
    --lead-50: #F2F2F2;

    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --success: #25D366;
    --error: #f08080;

    --font-display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    background: var(--lead-900);
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ================================
     BACKGROUND
  ================================= */

  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 70% 60% at 75% 15%,
        rgba(33,105,184,0.17) 0%,
        transparent 65%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 60% 50% at 5% 85%,
        rgba(30,84,144,0.12) 0%,
        transparent 65%
      ),
      var(--lead-900);
  }

  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(58,130,208,0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(58,130,208,0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 35%,
      black 0%,
      transparent 75%
    );
  }

  /* ================================
     HEADER
  ================================= */

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.2rem 6%;
    background: rgba(11,31,58,0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(58,130,208,0.15);
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .logo span {
    color: var(--blue-400);
  }

  .header-label {
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ================================
     MAIN
  ================================= */

  main {
    width: min(900px, 92%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     INTRO
  ================================= */

  .intro {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(33,105,184,0.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58,130,208,0.3);
    color: var(--blue-300);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--blue-400);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .intro h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--blue-400),
      var(--blue-300)
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .intro p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .intro-meta {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--lead-400);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     QUIZ SHELL
  ================================= */

  .quiz-shell {
    background: rgba(30,30,30,0.88);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58,130,208,0.14);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.28),
      0 0 80px rgba(33,105,184,0.04);
  }

  /* ================================
     PROGRESS
  ================================= */

  .progress-area {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.055);
    background: rgba(20,20,20,0.45);
  }

  .progress-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .progress-label {
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .progress-number {
    color: var(--blue-300);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .progress-track {
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--lead-600);
    border-radius: 100px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .progress-bar {
    height: 100%;
    width: 0%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--blue-600),
      var(--blue-400)
    );
    border-radius: 100px;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* ================================
     QUESTIONS
  ================================= */

  .quiz-content {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .question-screen {
    display: none;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both;
  }

  .question-screen.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .section-marker {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--blue-400);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .question-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .question-description {
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  /* ================================
     FORM ELEMENTS
  ================================= */

  .field {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .field:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .field-label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--lead-200);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
  }

  .required {
    color: var(--blue-400);
  }

  .input,
  .textarea,
  .select {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--lead-600);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 11px;
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    outline: none;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s,
      box-shadow 0.2s,
      background 0.2s;
  }

  .input:focus,
  .textarea:focus,
  .select:focus {
    border-color: rgba(58,130,208,0.65);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(33,105,184,0.1);
    background: var(--lead-700);
  }

  .input::placeholder,
  .textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--lead-400);
  }

  .textarea {
    min-height: 130px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .select {
    appearance: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--lead-300) 50%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--lead-300) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-position:
      calc(100% - 18px) 50%,
      calc(100% - 13px) 50%;
    background-size: 5px 5px, 5px 5px;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .select option {
    background: var(--lead-700);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  /* ================================
     OPTIONS
  ================================= */

  .options {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .option {
    position: relative;
  }

  .option input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .option label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--lead-700);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: var(--lead-200);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s,
      background 0.2s,
      color 0.2s,
      transform 0.2s;
  }

  .option label:hover {
    border-color: rgba(58,130,208,0.3);
    color: var(--white);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .option input:checked + label {
    border-color: rgba(58,130,208,0.65);
    background: rgba(33,105,184,0.13);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .option-marker {
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
    border: 1px solid var(--lead-400);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .option input:checked + label .option-marker {
    border-color: var(--blue-400);
    background: var(--blue-500);
  }

  .option input:checked + label .option-marker::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .checkbox-option .option-marker {
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  .checkbox-option input:checked + label .option-marker::after {
    content: '✓';
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ================================
     TWO COLUMNS
  ================================= */

  .two-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     REPEATER
  ================================= */

  .repeater {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .repeater-item {
    background: rgba(42,42,42,0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .repeater-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--blue-300);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     HELP TEXT
  ================================= */

  .help {
    color: var(--lead-400);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ================================
     NAVIGATION
  ================================= */

  .quiz-navigation {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.2s,
      border-color 0.2s,
      color 0.2s,
      transform 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    border: 1px solid var(--blue-500);
    background: var(--blue-500);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--blue-400);
    border-color: var(--blue-400);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--lead-300);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    color: var(--white);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
  }

  .btn-submit {
    min-width: 190px;
  }

  /* ================================
     REVIEW
  ================================= */

  .review-intro {
    background: rgba(33,105,184,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58,130,208,0.16);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .review-intro p {
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .review-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    padding: 1.2rem 0;
  }

  .review-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .review-section-title {
    color: var(--blue-300);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .review-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .review-key {
    color: var(--lead-400);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .review-value {
    color: var(--lead-200);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* ================================
     SUCCESS
  ================================= */

  .success-screen {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
  }

  .success-icon {
    width: 74px;
    height: 74px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(37,211,102,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(37,211,102,0.3);
    color: var(--success);
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .success-screen h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .success-screen p {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--lead-300);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ================================
     ERRORS
  ================================= */

  .error-message {
    display: none;
    color: var(--error);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .field.invalid .input,
  .field.invalid .textarea,
  .field.invalid .select {
    border-color: rgba(240,128,128,0.55);
  }

  .field.invalid .error-message {
    display: block;
  }

  .global-error {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,128,128,0.3);
    background: rgba(220,50,50,0.08);
    color: var(--error);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ================================
     FOOTER
  ================================= */

  footer {
    width: min(900px, 92%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    text-align: center;
  }

  footer p {
    color: var(--lead-500);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  footer strong {
    color: var(--lead-400);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ================================
     ANIMATIONS
  ================================= */

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }

    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* ================================
     RESPONSIVE
  ================================= */

  @media (max-width: 700px) {

    header {
      padding: 1rem 5%;
    }

    .header-label {
      display: none;
    }

    main {
      width: 94%;
      padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .intro h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .quiz-shell {
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .progress-area {
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .quiz-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .two-columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .review-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.15rem;
    }

    .quiz-navigation {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .success-screen {
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <a href="https://teovox.com.br" class="logo">Teo<span>vox</span></a>
  <div class="header-label">Briefing para criação do site</div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="intro" id="intro">
    <div class="badge">Projeto de novo site</div>

    <h1>
      Vamos construir o site<br>
      da sua <em>igreja</em>
    </h1>

    <p>
      Para criarmos um site que represente fielmente a sua igreja,
      precisamos conhecer melhor sua história, identidade, liderança,
      ministérios, programação e as informações que você deseja
      apresentar aos visitantes.
    </p>

    <div class="intro-meta">
      <span>●</span>
      Tempo estimado: 8–12 minutos
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUIZ -->
  <div class="quiz-shell" id="quiz-shell">

    <div class="progress-area">
      <div class="progress-top">
        <span class="progress-label">Progresso do briefing</span>
        <span class="progress-number" id="progress-number">1 de 12</span>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-track">
        <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-bar"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form id="quiz-form">

      <div class="quiz-content">

        <!-- ==========================================
             ETAPA 1
        =========================================== -->

        <div class="question-screen active" data-step="1">

          <span class="section-marker">01 / Sobre a igreja</span>

          <h2 class="question-title">
            Vamos começar conhecendo a sua igreja.
          </h2>

          <p class="question-description">
            Essas informações serão utilizadas para construir a apresentação
            institucional e ajudar a equipe da Teovox a compreender a identidade
            da igreja.
          </p>

          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label">
              Nome oficial da igreja <span class="required">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              class="input"
              type="text"
              name="igreja_nome"
              placeholder="Ex.: Igreja Batista Central"
              required
            >
            <div class="error-message">Informe o nome da igreja.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="two-columns">

            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label">
                Nome pelo qual é conhecida
              </label>
              <input
                class="input"
                type="text"
                name="igreja_nome_conhecido"
                placeholder="Se houver"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label">
                Denominação / tradição
              </label>
              <input
                class="input"
                type="text"
                name="igreja_denominacao"
                placeholder="Ex.: Batista, Assembleia de Deus..."
              >
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label">
              Slogan, lema ou frase da igreja
            </label>
            <input
              class="input"
              type="text"
              name="igreja_slogan"
              placeholder="Se houver"
            >
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label">
              Conte brevemente a história da igreja
            </label>
            <textarea
              class="textarea"
              name="igreja_historia"
              placeholder="Como surgiu, quando foi fundada, acontecimentos importantes..."
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label">
              Como você descreveria a igreja para alguém que nunca ouviu falar dela?
            </label>
            <textarea
              class="textarea"
              name="igreja_descricao"
              placeholder="Escreva da forma mais natural possível."
            ></textarea>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- ==========================================
             ETAPA 2
        =========================================== -->

        <div class="question-screen" data-step="2">

          <span class="section-marker">02 / Missão e identidade</span>

          <h2 class="question-title">
            O que define a igreja?
          </h2>

          <p class="question-description">
            Queremos entender os princípios que orientam a igreja para que
            o conteúdo do site seja coerente com sua identidade.
          </p>

          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label">Missão</label>
            <textarea
              class="textarea"
              name="identidade_missao"
              placeholder="Se houver uma declaração oficial, cole aqui."
            ></textarea>
          </div>

